{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-art-bay","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"art-bay","about":"Experience the epitome of luxury living at Art Bay Ellington, an exclusive residential development nestled along the picturesque Al Jaddaf Waterfront in Dubai. Crafted by Ellington Properties, this Art bay Al Jaddaf redefines urban living with its blend of elegance, artistry, and wellness. Discover a range of sophisticated studios, 1, 2, and 3-bedroom apartments meticulously designed to elevate your lifestyle. Each residence at Art Bay Ellington offers panoramic views of Dubai Creek Harbour, providing a serene escape from the bustling city life.Designed with sustainability in mind, Art Bay Ellington features stone facades and wooden shading, ensuring energy efficiency while enhancing its aesthetic appeal. Step inside to discover interiors adorned with porcelain ceramic tiles and granite-marble surfaces, creating an atmosphere of refined luxury. More than just a place to live, Art Bay Ellington fosters a sense of community and creativity. Surrounded by galleries, museums, and family-friendly amenities, it offers an inspiring environment for those who seek artistic expression and holistic well-being.Investors and homebuyers alike will appreciate Art Bay Ellington's prime location, meticulous design, and proximity to key amenities. With competitive Art Bay Ellington prices and a variety of floor plans to choose from, this development is a sought-after destination in Dubai's real estate market. Elevate your lifestyle and discover the perfect blend of luxury and logic at Art Bay Ellington. Experience a new standard of urban living in the heart of Dubai.","price":950000,"title":"Art Bay","bitrix":{"id":345,"pf_id":"are.2.13553","source":null,"project_id":"Art Bay","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Art Bay","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Ellington Properties","project_loca